<view class="page {{theme}}"><text class="eyebrow">DISCOVER YOUR COCKTAIL DNA</text><view class="title">你的口味，有迹可循。</view><view class="subtitle">选几种喜欢的味道，调出你的风味坐标。</view>
  <view class="panel section"><view class="section-title">喜欢什么味道？</view><view class="palette"><view wx:for="{{palette}}" wx:key="key" class="flavor {{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="toggle"><view class="flavor-dot" style="background:{{item.color}}">{{item.selected ? '✓' : ''}}</view><text>{{item.name}}</text></view></view><view class="label">喜欢的酒感</view><view class="wrap"><text wx:for="{{strengths}}" wx:key="key" class="chip {{strength === item.key ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="strength">{{item.name}}</text></view><button class="section" bindtap="save">保存偏好，发现下一杯</button></view>
  <view class="panel"><view class="section-title">实时口味预览</view><view style="height:240rpx"><bar-art look="{{previewLook}}" /></view><view wx:for="{{previewBars}}" wx:key="name" class="bar-row"><text class="bar-label">{{item.name}}</text><view class="bar-track"><view class="bar-fill" style="width:{{item.value}}%" /></view><text class="bar-value">{{item.value}}</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{dna.ready}}" class="panel"><view class="row"><view class="section-title">{{dna.stage}}</view><text class="badge">{{dna.count}} 款真实评价</text></view><view class="muted">{{dna.description}}</view><view class="section"><view wx:for="{{bars}}" wx:key="name" class="bar-row"><text class="bar-label">{{item.name}}</text><view class="bar-track"><view class="bar-fill" style="width:{{item.value}}%" /></view><text class="bar-value">{{item.value}}</text></view></view><view class="info">{{dna.evidence}}</view></view>
  <view wx:for="{{recommendations}}" wx:key="title" class="section"><view class="section-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted" style="margin-bottom:20rpx">{{item.subtitle}}</view><view wx:for="{{item.items}}" wx:for-item="drink" wx:key="id" class="panel row" data-id="{{drink.id}}" bindtap="open"><image class="recommend-art" src="{{drink.image}}" mode="aspectFit" /><view class="grow"><view class="card-name">{{drink.name}}</view><view class="badge">匹配 {{drink.score}} · {{drink.base}}</view><view class="small muted">{{drink.reason}}</view></view><text>↗</text></view></view>
  <view class="info">风味来自材料与用量的编辑估计，不是实测口感或酒精度。匹配分用于探索，不代表喜欢的概率；在配方页评价喝过的酒，可以逐渐完善 DNA。</view>
</view>
